{"version":1,"content":"<p>為進一步推動粵港澳大灣區高水準文化協同發展，被譽為「民樂翹楚」、「香港文化名片」的香港中樂團與大灣區文化地標星海音樂廳持續深化戰略合作。</p><p>由星海音樂廳主辦的「粵港澳大灣區文化藝術節」重點節目──「大師神韻—香港中樂團經典國風」音樂會於2026</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T05:28:27.679189+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T05:00:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T05:21:47.814708+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T05:21:47.814708+00:00","content_hash":"16c1be4554bcae80c9d6ca1d58e524186b3e9a89947992f8720ecea4b098600d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}